{"id":"wb-7-1181","name":"显圣王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"显圣王庙","text":"显圣王庙位于中华人民共和国河南省孟州市会昌街道堤北头村，由元代大殿及清代舞楼、戏楼等建筑组成。大殿为三间悬山顶木构建筑，前后檐采用不同的斗拱形制，内部保留减柱布局和通檐梁架。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%BE%E5%9C%A3%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":95427204,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427204","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/35a10bebb8e14615d0bfde3b.jpg","title":"20261002_Xianshengwang_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20261002_Xianshengwang_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/20261002_Xianshengwang_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南孟州 显圣王庙","width":320,"height":213}}